<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling steady on dollar, up on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling steady on dollar, up on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling remained unchanged against the dollar but gained against sterling, the central bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Against the dollar, the shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 600.1875 and against pound sterling, the local currency exchanged at 963.1839 compared to Friday's 968.9617.</p>
</text>
